    "parsing_res_list": [
        {
            "block_label": "header",
            "block_content": "Trust Deed for a Self Managed Superannuation Fund.",
            "block_bbox": [
                301,
                72,
                880,
                105
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": null
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b.When the Fund is wound up, each Member will receive notice thereof in writing and Member Benefits will be paid to and for the benefit of any eligible Fund Member only.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                219,
                181,
                1048,
                274
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "24. Member Benefits upon Death:",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                331,
                535,
                363
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. The Death Benefit agreement nominations will be as follows:",
            "block_bbox": [
                216,
                398,
                928,
                428
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "i.John Summers - 100% to Sandra Summers ",
            "block_bbox": [
                304,
                459,
                820,
                485
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "ii.  Sandra Summers - 100% to John Summers ",
            "block_bbox": [
                298,
                521,
                809,
                546
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. Where there is no valid Death Benefit nomination, the Trustees may pay the Member Balance to dependants or legal personal representatives in any proportions that the Trustee deems appropriate at that time.",
            "block_bbox": [
                217,
                582,
                1072,
                672
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. This Trust Deed provides for the use of Pension Reversionary Benefits upon the death of a member. The Trustees will decide if an income stream (pension) or a lump sum will be paid on the death of the deceased member.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                221,
                706,
                1062,
                821
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "25. Administration of the Fund:",
            "block_bbox": [
                148,
                859,
                513,
                881
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Fund is set up and will be administered by Superannuation Warehouse Australia Pty Ltd. This includes preparation of annual financial statements, fulfilling the duties as tax agent and appointing the auditor.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                107,
                914,
                1058,
                1002
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The practice details are as follows:.\nPrincipal -- Hein Preller Institute of Chartered Accountants in Australia.\nMember number 2159543 \\ 480 Collins Street, Melbourne, VIC, 3000",
            "block_bbox": [
